<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HOS" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Hose Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hose Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hose</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hose</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hose Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Pudeha kawotetha wursetha laythan, Hosey, nabiya Amoxepe kaallidi nabe gidis. Hanotati meto gidi de7iya wode pudeha bagga Isra7eele kawotetha bolla Hosey tinbite odis.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha maxaafan, koyro heedzu shempotan, Hosey ba soo asara leemiso gididi Isra7eele sabbakis. Goday, Isra7eeley ammanetona biitta gideysa qoncisanaw koydi, Hosey layma maccas macho oothidi ekana mela odis. Ba yelida nayta woygidi sunthaneko iyaw odis. Nayta sunthay Isra7eeley wonto waanada pirdetaneko mallees. He nayta suntha birshethay, Izra7eele, (Xoossay laallana); Loruhaama (Maarotethi demmonaaro); Lo7aama (Ta ase gidenna) guussu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shempo 4—14 gakanaw de7iya kifiley, Hose machiya ammanetona macho gideysada, Isra7eeley Xoossas ammanetona ixidaysa Hose tinbitey besse. Gomera Hose aggada hara ba laggethotako bidaysada (shem 1), Isra7eeley Xoosse aggada bidaysa (shem 2) bessees. Gidoshin, Hosey ba ammanetona machiw dosana mela Goday kiittis. Hessika, Xoossay ba merina siiquwan Isra7eele dosidaysas leemiso. Goday Isra7eeles ammanetikoka, Isra7eeley wodepe woden Godaas ammanetabuku. Enti banta kawotetha ashshanaw Godan zempanaysa aggidi, banta olanchotaninne allaga biittata bolla zempidosona. Hessa xalaala gidonashin, “Nuus kathi immeynne mehey yeletana mela oothey nu eeqa xoossata” gidi entan ammanetidosona; enta goyinnidosona.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha maxaafan Goday Isra7eelenne Yihuda meton yeggidi, enti menthida caaquwa gisho oyshetana mela oothis. Shin enti he ubba haninka Goday enta dosees. Enti banta nagarape simmidi iyaw ammanetiko, I enta zaaridi ekanawunne anjanaw qaala gelis. Goday, “Ta hanqoy entafe simmida gisho, taani enta, enta iita hanuwape pathada, enta tuma dosana” (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 14:4">14:4</ref></char>) yaagis.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Hosey layma macho ekoy Isra7eele leemiso <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HOS 1:1-3:5">1:1—3:5</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammanetona Isra7eele bolla odetida tinbite <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HOS 4:1-10:15">4:1—10:15</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ba asaas de7iya Godaa siiquwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HOS 11:1-11">11:1-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Isra7eele zaara zaara nagara oothasu <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HOS 11:12-13:16">11:12—13:16</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Sinthan de7iya maarotanne anjuwa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="HOS 14:1-9">14:1-9</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HOS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 1:1" />Ooziyani, Iyo7atami, Akaazinne Hizqiyaasi kaalli kaalli Yihudan kawotida wode qassi Yo7aasa na7ay Iyorbaami Isra7eelen kawotida wode Bi7eera na7aa Hoseko yida Godaa qaalay haysa.<verse eid="HOS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hose Machiwnne Iya Nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 1:2" />Goday koyro Hose baggara odida wode “Ta asay taape haakidi iita laymatethi oothida gisho, neeni bada, layma maccas ekada layma nayta iipe yela” yaagis.<verse eid="HOS 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 1:3" />Hessa gisho, Hosey bidi, Dibilayma na7iw Gomero ekin, iya qanthatada adde na7a yelasu. <verse eid="HOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 1:4" />Yaatin, Goday Hoseko ne na7a suntha, “Izra7eele” (laallana woyko zerana) yaagada suntha. Ayis giiko, Izra7eelen gukida suuthaa gisho taani Iyyu kochaa qantha woden pirdana; Isra7eele kawotethaaka dhaysana. <verse eid="HOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 1:5" />He gallas taani Izra7eela zangaaran Isra7eele olanchota mentherethana.<verse eid="HOS 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 1:6" />Gomera nam7antho qanthatada, macca na7a yelasu. Yaatin, Goday Hoseko, “I suntha Loruhaama (Maarotethi demmonaaro) yaagada suntha. Ayis giiko, hizape guye taani Isra7eele asas qadhetike; entaw atto giike. <verse eid="HOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 1:7" />Shin taani Yihuda asaas qadhetana; taani enta dongen woyko mashshan woyko olan woyko paratan woyko para asatan gidonashin, taani Goday, enta Xoossay, ta wolqan enta ashshana” yaagis.<verse eid="HOS 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 1:8" />Gomera Loruhaamo dhanthi duuthidaape guye qanthatada hara adde na7a yelasu. <verse eid="HOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 1:9" />Yaatin, Goday Hoseko, “Iya sunthaa Lo7aama (Ta ase gidenna) yaagada suntha. Ayis giiko, hinte ta ase gideketa; taka hinte Xoosse gidike.<verse eid="HOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 1:10" />“Gidoshin, Isra7eele asay makanawunne taybanaw danda7etonna abba shafiya mela gidana. Enti, ‘Hinte ta ase gideketa’ geetetidi xeegetida bessan hinte ‘De7o Xoossaa nayta’ geetetana. <verse eid="HOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 1:11" />Yihuda asaynne Isra7eele asay issife shiiqidi bantaw issi halaqa dooridi di7etida biittafe simmananne injetidi daana. He gallasay Izra7eeles gita gallas gidana.<verse eid="HOS 1:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HOS 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 2:1" />“Hinte ishata, ‘Ta ase’ qassi hinte micheta, ‘Maarotethi demmidaysata’ yaagidi xeegite.<verse eid="HOS 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Seeretethinne Simo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 2:2" />“Hinte aayiw hanqetite; iyo kaccite. Ayis giiko, iya ta macho giduku; taka I azina gidike. Iya ba som7uwafe laymatetha mallaa diggo; laymatetha oosuwa ba dhanthata giddofe diggo. <verse eid="HOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 2:3" />Hessi hanonna ixiko iya yeletida gallasaada, taani iyo xire kallo ashshana. Qassi iyo melida mela biitta oothana; taani iyo saamon wodhana. <verse eid="HOS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 2:4" />Enti laymepe yeletida nayta gidida gisho, taani I naytas qadhetike. <verse eid="HOS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 2:5" />Enta aayiya laymatasu; kawushabaa hanada enta qanthatasu. Iya, ‘Taani ta kathaanne ta haatha, ta suufiyanne ta liinuwa, ta zaytiyanne ta ushsha taw immiya ta laggethota kaallada baana’ yaagasu. <verse eid="HOS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 2:6" />Hessa gisho, taani I ogiya agunthan gordana; iya ba ogiya demmonna mela taani I yuushuwa gimben dirana. <verse eid="HOS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 2:7" />Iya ba laggethota geedo woxana, shin gakuku; enta koyana, shin demmuku. Hessafe guye, ‘Ha77i duussaafe taw beniysi lo77o gidiya gisho, simmada ta koyro azinaako baana’ yaagana. <verse eid="HOS 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 2:8" />Kathaa, woyne ushshaanne zaytiya iw immidaynne enti Ba7aale eeqas yarshiya biraanne worqaa iw darsiday tana gideysa iya eronna ixasu. <verse eid="HOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 2:9" />Hessa gisho, kaxiya wode ta kathaa, teeriya wode ta woyniya iipe zaarada ekana. Iya ba kalluwa kammiya suufiyanne liinuwa iipe qaara ekana. <verse eid="HOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 2:10" />I laggethota sinthan taani I kalluwa qaarana; ta kushiyape iyo oonika ashshena. <verse eid="HOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 2:11" />Taani I ufaysa ba7aaleta ubbaa, ageena xeero gallasata, I Sambaata gallasata, laythan laythan bonchetiya ba7aaleta ashshana. <verse eid="HOS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 2:12" />Iya, ‘Ta laggethoti taw immida ciga’ giya woyniyanne balase mithaa ta dhaysana; taani he bessa wora oothana; bazzo do7ati iya maana. <verse eid="HOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 2:13" />Iya tana dogada ba laggethota kaallada, sagaayotaninne alleeqotan alleeqetada, Ba7aale eeqas ixaane cuyisida gallasata gisho taani iyo seerana; yaagees Goday.<verse eid="HOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 2:14" />“Hessa gisho, taani iyo cimmada mela biitta ehada, iw siiqo qaalan odana. <verse eid="HOS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 2:15" />Yan taani I woyne gade iw zaarada immana; Akoora zangaara (meto zangaara) iw ufaysa penge oothana. Gibxe biittafe keyida wodiyada ba geela7otetha laythan de7iya hanotan ufaysan yexana” yaagees.<verse eid="HOS 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 2:16" />He gallas iya tana, “Ta azinaw” yaagada xeegana; kaseysada, “Ta godaw” yaagada xeeguku. <verse eid="HOS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 2:17" />Ayis giiko, taani I doonape “Ba7aale” eeqata sunthaa diggana; hizape guye taani iyo “Ba7aale” suntha xeegisike. <verse eid="HOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 2:18" />He wode taani ta asaa gisho sa7aa do7atara, salo kafotaranne biittara gooshetiya medhetethatara caaqana. Taani biittafe donge, mashshenne ola dhaysana. Enti biitta bolla saro daana.<verse eid="HOS 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 2:19" />Taani nena merinaw taw macho oothana; xillotethan, suure pirdan, merinaa siiquwaninne maarotethan taw giigisana. <verse eid="HOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HOS 2:20" />Taani ammanetada nena taw giigisana; neka Godaa erana.<verse eid="HOS 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HOS 2:21" />“He wode taani zaaro immana; taani salotas zaaro immana, saloti sa7aas zaaro immana. <verse eid="HOS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HOS 2:22" />Sa7ay kathaas, woyne ushshasinne zaytiyas zaaro immana; enti Izra7eeles (Xoossay tokana) zaaro immana. <verse eid="HOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HOS 2:23" />Taani iyo ta gisho gada biitta bolla tokana; Kase taani, ‘Maarike’ gidaysata maarana; ‘Ta ase gideketa’; gidaysata, ‘Ta ase’ gaana. Entika tana, ‘Neeni nu Xoossaa’ yaagana” yaagees Goday.<verse eid="HOS 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HOS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Hosey Ba Machera Sigetetha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 3:1" />Goday tana, “Isra7eele asay hara xoossatako simmidi, zabibe uythaa yarshanaw koykoka, Goday enta doseysada iyo dosa. Iya hara laggethiyabanne laymatiyaba gidikoka neeni iyo dosa” yaagis.<verse eid="HOS 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 3:2" />Yaagin, taani iyo tammanne ichashu bira santimeninne xeetanne ishatamu kilo giraame bangan shammas. <verse eid="HOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 3:3" />Taani iyo, “Neeni laymatonnanne hara addera doonna taara daro wode daanaw koshshees. Taanika neera daana” yaagas.<verse eid="HOS 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 3:4" />Isra7eele asay kawoy woyko halaqi bayna, yarshoy woyko eeqa tuussi bayna, efuude ma7oy woyko eeqa misiley bayna daro wode daana. <verse eid="HOS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 3:5" />Hessafe guye, Isra7eele asay Godaa banta Xoossaakonne banta kawa Dawitako simmana. Wursetha wodiyan enti kokorishe, Godaakonne iya anjuwako yaana.<verse eid="HOS 3:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HOS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Goday Isra7eele Mootees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 4:1" />Ha biittan de7iya asa ubbaa, Goday mootiyabay de7iya gisho, Isra7eele asato, Godaa qaala si7ite. Hessika, biitta bolla ammanetethi, siiqoynne Xoossaa eroy baawa. <verse eid="HOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 4:2" />Ha biitta bolla de7ey baadethi, wordo, shempo wodho, kaysotonne layma xalaala. Enti woga ubbaa menthosona; suuthu gussoosona. <verse eid="HOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 4:3" />Hessa gaason biitta ubbay yeekana; biittan de7iya ubbay daaburana. Sa7a do7ati, salo kafotinne abba moloti hayqana.<verse eid="HOS 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 4:4" />Hinteno, kahineto, taani hintena mootiyabay de7iya gisho, oonika hara asara palametofo; woyko hara asi mootopo. <verse eid="HOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 4:5" />Hinte gallasinne qamma dhubeteeta; nabetika hintera dhubetoosona. Hessa gisho, taani hinte aayiw dhaysana. <verse eid="HOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 4:6" />Ta asaas eratethi bayna gisho dhayidosona. Hinte eratethi ixida gisho, taka hinte taw kahine gidonna mela ixas. Hinte Xoossaa higgiya dogida gisho, taka hinte nayta dogana.<verse eid="HOS 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 4:7" />Kahineta tayboy dari dari biya wode tana guji guji naaqidosona; taani enta bonchuwa qaarada yeellayana. <verse eid="HOS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 4:8" />Ta asaa nagaray entaw kathi gidida gisho enti ta asay balaba oothana mela koyoosona. <verse eid="HOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 4:9" />Kahineti deriyape dummatibokona. Taani enta hanota gisho, enta seerana; enta oosuwada entaw zaarana. <verse eid="HOS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 4:10" />Enti Godaa aggida gisho maana, shin kallokona; laymatana, shin na7a yelokona. <verse eid="HOS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 4:11" />Laymatethi, gam7ida woyne ushshinne mal7anto woyne ushshi ta asaa wozanaa dhaysis. <verse eid="HOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 4:12" />Enti mithafe oosetida eeqa misile zore oychoosona; enta xam7ay enta oysha zaarees. Laymatetha ayyaanay enta balethis; enti banta Xoossaafe haakidi laymatidosona. <verse eid="HOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 4:13" />Dereta huuphen yarsho yarshoosona; lo77o kuyay de7iya wolaa garsan, xiidda garsan ixaane cuyisoosona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HOS 4:13">Hessa gisho, hinte macca nayti laymatoosona; hinte nayta macheti laammoosona. <verse eid="HOS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 4:14" />Hinte macca nayti laymatiya wodenne hinte nayta macheti laammiya wode taani seerike. Ayis giiko, addeti banta huuphen laymateysatara laggetoosona; entara yarshoosona. Hessa gisho, akeeki bayna derey dhayana.<verse eid="HOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 4:15" />“Isra7eele asato, hinte laymatikoka, Yihuda asay hinteysada bala gidopo. Galgala boopite; Beet-Aweena (Iitatetha keethi) keyopite; ‘De7o Xoossay eriya mela’ gidi caaqofite. <verse eid="HOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 4:16" />Isra7eele asay geella ussada geellatis. Yaatin, Goday entana dalga denban dorsa marada waatidi heemmanee? <verse eid="HOS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 4:17" />Efreemi eeqatara gahetis; enta aggaagite. <verse eid="HOS 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HOS 4:18" />Enti daro woyne ushsha uyi simmidi, laymatethi aggokona; enta halaqatika yeellayaba daro dosoosona. <verse eid="HOS 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HOS 4:19" />Enta carkoy efana; banta eeqas yarshida yarshota gaason enti yeellatana.”<verse eid="HOS 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HOS 5" />
  <para style="s1">Godaa Pirday Isra7eele Bolla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 5:1" />“Hinteno kahineto, haysa si7ite! Hinteno Isra7eele asato, akeekite! Kawo keetha asato, loythi si7ite! Ha pirday hinte bolla pirdetis. Hinte Mixiphas xihe gidideta; Taabore zuma bolla miccetida giteda gidideta. <verse eid="HOS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 5:2" />Geellati wodho aggibokona; hessa gisho, ta enta ubbaa seerana. <verse eid="HOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 5:3" />Taani Efreema erayis; Isra7eeley taape geemmibeenna. Efreema, neeni ha77i layma gidadasa; Isra7eeley tunis.”<verse eid="HOS 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 5:4" />“Isra7eele asay banta Xoossaako simmonna mela enta iita oosoy enta teqis. Laymatetha ayyaani enta wozanan de7iya gisho enti Godaa erokona. <verse eid="HOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 5:5" />Isra7eele asaa otoroy enta bolla markatees. Isra7eele asaynne Efreema asay banta nagara gaason dhubetoosona; Yihuda asayka entara dhubetees. <verse eid="HOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 5:6" />Enti Godaas yarshanaw banta dorsa wudiyanne mehe wudiya laagi ekidi iya koyanaw baana; shin I entafe shaaketida gisho iya demmokona. <verse eid="HOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 5:7" />Enti laymatethan nayta yelida gisho Godaas ammanetibokona. Hessa gisho, issi ageenan entinne enta biittay dhayana. <verse eid="HOS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 5:8" />Gib7a kataman moyze, Rama kataman zaye punnite. Biniyaame asaw, ‘Guye simmidi be7ite’ yaagidi Beet-Aweenan waassite. <verse eid="HOS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 5:9" />Seeretiya wode Efreemi baysa gidana. Isra7eele kochaa giddon tuma hananaba taani awaajana.<verse eid="HOS 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 5:10" />“Goday, ‘Yihuda halaqati zawa sugiya asa mela gididosona; taani ta hanquwa enta bolla di7o haathada gussana. <verse eid="HOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 5:11" />Efreema asay eridi eeqa goyinnida gisho, suure pirdan un7etidosona; tinchetidosona. <verse eid="HOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 5:12" />Hessa gisho, taani Efreema asaas bile, Yihuda asaas xoodha gidana.<verse eid="HOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 5:13" />“ ‘Efreemi ba hargiya, Yihudi ba madunthaa be7ida wode Efreemi Asoore biitta bis; he gita kawa maado oychis. Shin I enta hargiya dhallanaw woyko enta madunthaa pathanaw danda7ibeenna. <verse eid="HOS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 5:14" />Hessa gisho, taani Efreemas gaammoda hanana; Yihudas wodala gaammoda hanana. Taani enta mentherethada eka baana; oonika enta ta kushepe ashshena. <verse eid="HOS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 5:15" />Enti banta bala akeekana gakanawunne tana koyana gakanaw taani guye ta bessaa simmana. Enti banta waayan tana minthidi koyana’ ” yaagees.<verse eid="HOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HOS 6" />
  <para style="s1">Isra7eeley Simmibeenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 6:1" />Isra7eele asay, “Haayite! Ane Godaako simmoos. I nuna mentherethis, shin I nuna koolana; I nuna madunxisis, shin I nu madunthaa qachana. <verse eid="HOS 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 6:2" />Nam7u gallasape guye I nuna pathana; heedzantho gallasan nu iya sinthan daana mela nuna denthana. <verse eid="HOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 6:3" />Ane Godaa eroos; iya eranaw minthidi kaalloos. Xalqey doleysada I qoncana; torche iri yeysada I nuuko yaana” yaagidosona.<verse eid="HOS 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 6:4" />Goday, “Ta hintena Efreema asaa waato? Ta hintena Yihuda asaa waato? Hinte siiqoy wonta xaasa mela; ellesidi dhayiya aka mela. <verse eid="HOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 6:5" />Hessa gisho, taani nabeta baggara hintena qanxerethas; ta doonape keyida qaalan hintena wodhas. Ta pirday hinte bolla poo7oda wagaggi gaana. <verse eid="HOS 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 6:6" />Ta yarsho gidonashin maarota koyayis; xuussa yarsho gidonashin Xoossaa ero koyayis.<verse eid="HOS 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 6:7" />“Shin enti Addaameda, caaqo menthidosona; yan taw ammanetona ixidosona. <verse eid="HOS 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 6:8" />Galada katamay suuthi gukiya iita ooso oothiya asay kumida katama. <verse eid="HOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 6:9" />Pangati ase wodhanaw qosetidi naageysada kahineta cugay hessada naagoosona. Seekema katamaa efiya ogiyan naagidi ase wodhoosona; enti yeellaya worandzo ooso oothosona. <verse eid="HOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 6:10" />Taani Isra7eele asaa giddon daganthiyaba be7as. Efreema giddon laymatethi de7ees; Isra7eeley tunis.<verse eid="HOS 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 6:11" />“Yihuda, taani ta asaa di7uwa zaariya wode new qassi caka wode giigisas.<verse eid="HOS 6:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HOS 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 7:1" />“Taani Isra7eele pathanaw koyiya wode Efreema nagaraynne Samaare asaa iita oosoy qoncis. Enti ubba wode cimmoosona; kaysoti menthidi geloosona; pangati keyidi bonqoosona. <verse eid="HOS 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 7:2" />Shin taani enta iita ooso ubbaa ereysa akeekokona. Enta iita oosoy enta naaqi oykis; he iita oosoy ubba wode ta sinthan de7ees.<verse eid="HOS 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 7:3" />“Enti kawa banta iitatethan, halaqata banta worduwan ufaysoosona. <verse eid="HOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 7:4" />Enti ubbay laammoosona; munuqay dendana gakanaw daabbo uukeysi tama shiisho koshshonaysada enti teellida cooce mela. <verse eid="HOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 7:5" />Banta kawa boncho ba7aale gallasan halaqati woyne ushshan mathotidosona. Ika qelqiseysatas ba kushiya immis. <verse eid="HOS 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 7:6" />Enta wozanay tama cooce mela; enti shiiqidi iitabaa maqetidosona. Enta hanqoy qamma kumetha cuuyishe aqees; sa7i wontiya wode tama lacoda eexees. <verse eid="HOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 7:7" />Enti ubbay teellida cooce mela banta halaqata moosona. Enta kawoti ubbay kundidosona; entafe oonika tana xeegey baawa.<verse eid="HOS 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 7:8" />“Efreema asay hara kawotetha asaara walaketis; Efreema asay shiretiboonna uytha mela gidis. <verse eid="HOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 7:9" />Allagati iya wolqaa midosona, shin I hessa eribeenna; iya huuphey puulumis, shin I hessa akeekibena. <verse eid="HOS 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 7:10" />Isra7eele asaa otoroy enta bolla markatees. Hessi ubbay haninka enti Godaako, banta Xoossaako, simmibokona woyko iya koybookona.<verse eid="HOS 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 7:11" />“Efreema asay holleda eeyanne coo cimeteyisata. Enti maado demmanaw issi toho Gibxe; issi toho Asoore simmoosona. <verse eid="HOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 7:12" />Enti biya wode taani enta bolla gite yeggana; taani enta kafo oykiyada oykana. Enta iita oosuwa gisho taani enta seerana.<verse eid="HOS 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 7:13" />“Enta ayye! Enti taape haakidosona. Entaw dhayo gido! Enti ta bolla makallidosona. Taani enta wozanaw koyas, shin enti ta bolla wordo haasayoosona. <verse eid="HOS 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 7:14" />Banta hiixan zin7idi zeleelosona, shin banta wozanaape woossokona. Kathasinne woyne ushshas banta asatethaa gaarosona, shin enti taape haakidosona.<verse eid="HOS 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 7:15" />“Enta loohisidaynne minthiday tana, shin taw iitabaa maqetoosona. <verse eid="HOS 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 7:16" />Enti hadabaako simmidosona. Enti ammanthona donge gididosona. Enta halaqati iitaba odetida gisho mashshan wurana; hessika entaw Gibxen miichas gidana.<verse eid="HOS 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HOS 8" />
  <para style="s1">Isra7eeley Carko Buuces</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 8:1" />“Moyze punna! Enti ta caaquwanne ta higgiya menthida gisho, Godaa asaa bolla morkey ankoda aales. <verse eid="HOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 8:2" />Isra7eele asay, ‘Abeeti nu Xoossaw, nuuni nena eroos’ yaagidi taako waassoosona. <verse eid="HOS 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 8:3" />Shin Isra7eele asay lo77oba ixida gisho, morkey enta yedethana. <verse eid="HOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 8:4" />Enti tana oychonna bantaw kawota kawothidosona; ta eronna de7ishin bantaw halaqata dooridosona. Dhayanaw machidi eeqa misileta banta birapenne worqafe medhidosona. <verse eid="HOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 8:5" />Samaare asaw, hinte mari daanisidi medhida eeqa ta ixas; ta hanqoy hinte bolla eexis. Enti tunida mela awude gakanaw daanee? <verse eid="HOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 8:6" />Ha mara eeqa misiley kushe hiillan medhetisipe attishin, I xoosse gidenna. Samaare eeqa misiley meqeretana.<verse eid="HOS 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 8:7" />“Enti carko zeridi gote buucosona. Eqon de7iya enta kathaas ayfey bentenna; dhiilleyka baawa; ayfey de7ikoka allagati maana. <verse eid="HOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 8:8" />Isra7eele asay ha77i allaga asaa giddon mitetidosona; enti pathonna asi gididosona. <verse eid="HOS 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 8:9" />Enti baddo harey barka toylateysa mela toylatishe Asoore bidosona. Efreema asay banta miishiyan laggetho shammidosona. <verse eid="HOS 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 8:10" />Bantana maaddana mela miishen shammikoka ta enta shiishana. Kare biitta kawotinne halaqati entana un7ethin enti coo dhayana.<verse eid="HOS 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 8:11" />“Efreema asay nagara yarsho yarshiya daro bessata keexis, shin he yarsho bessati nagara oothiya bessi gididosona. <verse eid="HOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 8:12" />Taani entaw ta higgiyan darobaa xaafas, shin enti he higgiya allagabada xeellidosona. <verse eid="HOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 8:13" />Enti yarshanaw dosoosona; yarsho ashuwa moosona, shin Goday enta yarshuwa ekibeenna. I ha77i enta nagara hassayana; enta nagaraa gisho enta seerana; enti Gibxe biitta simmana. <verse eid="HOS 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 8:14" />Isra7eele asay bana Medhidaysa dogidi, kawo gadhota keexis. Yihuda asay gimbetida daro katamata keexis. Shin taani he katamatan tama yeddin, enta miixa maana” yaagees.<verse eid="HOS 8:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HOS 9" />
  <para style="s1">Isra7eeley Seeretana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 9:1" />Isra7eele asato, ufaytofite! Hara kawotada poocu goopite! Hinte hinte Xoossaafe haakidi laymatideta; kathaa geeshshiya wudumman laymatethas immiya gatiya dosideta. <verse eid="HOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 9:2" />Hessa gisho, hinte wudummaafe kathi, gum7iya bessaafe woyne ushsha demmeketa; woyney hintew ayfena. <verse eid="HOS 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 9:3" />Enti Godaa biittan gam7okona. Efreemi Gibxe biitta simmana; Asoore biittan tuna kathi maana.<verse eid="HOS 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 9:4" />Enti Godaas woyne ushsha yarsho gussokona; enta yarshoy iya ufaysenna. He yarshoy entaw shocha mela gidana; hessa miya ubbay tunana. He kathay enta koshaa xalaala zaaranaasafe attishin, Godaara de7iya issifetethaas maaddenna. <verse eid="HOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 9:5" />Godaa hinte bonchana mela I hintew immida ba7aale gallasatan hinte ay oothanee? <verse eid="HOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 9:6" />Enti dhayope kessi ekikoka Gibxey enta shiishana; Mempisa katamay enta moogana. Enti shiishida bira miishe ubbaa sharaafi mittana; enti de7iya bessan buloy dolana.<verse eid="HOS 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 9:7" />Seera gallasi yis; pirda wodey gakis. Isra7eele asay hessa ero! Hinte nagaraa gishonne morketetha gisho nabey eeya mela Xoossa asi geetetidaysi gooshsha mela taybetis. <verse eid="HOS 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 9:8" />Nabey Xoossara gididi, Efreema naagees; shin iya ogiyan xihey yegetis; xoossa keethan iya morketethi naagees. <verse eid="HOS 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 9:9" />Gib7a kataman hanidaysada enti tunidosona. Xoossay enta naaquwa hassayana; nagaraa gisho enta seerana.<verse eid="HOS 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 9:10" />Goday, “Taani mela biittan woyne ayfe demmidaysada Isra7eele asaa demmas. Taani balase mithan koyro ayfe be7idaysada hinte aawata be7as. Shin enti Bi7eel-Fagoora geetetiya bessaa yidi, yeellayiya eeqas bantana dummayidosona; enti he dosida eeqada tunidosona. <verse eid="HOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 9:11" />Efreema bonchoy kafoda paalli dhayana; hizape guye yeloy baawa; qanthatoy baawa; atethi baawa. <verse eid="HOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 9:12" />Enti na7a yelidi dichiyaba gidikoka ta enta wodha wursana. Taani entafe haakida wode entana ayye! <verse eid="HOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 9:13" />Efreemi lo77o bessan toketida zamba mitha mela hanin be7as, shin ba nayta shukas aatha immis” yaagis.<verse eid="HOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 9:14" />Abeeti Godaw, entaw imma! Ne entaw ay immanee? Ne entaw boshetiya ulonne melida dhanthi imma.<verse eid="HOS 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 9:15" />Goday, “Enta iitatetha gisho taani Galgalan ixo doomas. Enta nagaraa gisho taani enta ta keethaafe gooddana; hizape guye ta enta dosike; enta halaqati ubbay geellata. <verse eid="HOS 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 9:16" />Efreemi deshetin, iya xaphoy melis; ayfeyka baawa. Enti na7a yelikoka taani enti dosiya nayta wodhana” yaagis.<verse eid="HOS 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HOS 9:17" />Enti iyaw kiitetonna ixida gisho ta Xoossay enta pixiri holana; enti kawotethata giddon toylatishe daana.<verse eid="HOS 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HOS 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 10:1" />Isra7eele asay daro ayfe ayfiya daayida woyne mela; enta ayfey darida mela eeqa yarsho bessata darsi keexidosona. Enta biittay duretida keena goyinniya eeqa tuussata alleeqisidi medhidosona. <verse eid="HOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 10:2" />Enta wozanay caaketis; ha77i enti banta nagaraa tookana. Goday enta yarsho bessata laallana; enta eeqa tuussata dhaysana.<verse eid="HOS 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 10:3" />He wode asay, “Nuuni Godaas yayyiboonna gisho, nuus kawoy baawa. Shin kawoy de7iyakoka nuus ay oothanee?” yaagana. <verse eid="HOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 10:4" />Enti hanonna ufaysa qaala geloosona; wordon caaqoosona; Hessa gisho, wodhiya harmey gaden doleysada enta bolla pirdi dolana. <verse eid="HOS 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 10:5" />Samaare kataman de7iya asay Beet-Aweenan de7iya mara misiliyas yashshan kokoroosona. Iya bonchoy iyape qaaretida gisho iyaw yeekana; he eeqa misiliya kahineti waassana. <verse eid="HOS 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 10:6" />He eeqa misiley Asoore tooketidi, bidi, gita kawas imota gididi imetana. Efreemi yeellatana; Isra7eeley eeqa misiliya gisho kawuyana.<verse eid="HOS 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 10:7" />Samaare kawoy haatha goponto gididi dhayana. <verse eid="HOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 10:8" />Isra7eele asay Aweena kataman eeqas goyinnishe, nagara oothiya dhoqa bessati laaletana. Enta yarsho bessan agunthinne gom7orey dolana. He wode enti deretako, “Nuna qosite!” zumatako, “Nuna genthite” yaagana.<verse eid="HOS 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 10:9" />Goday, “Isra7eele asaw, Gib7an hinte nagara ooso doomida wodiyape, hachi gakanaw nagara ooso aggibeketa. Hessa gisho, iita ootheyisata Gib7an oli wursibeenee? <verse eid="HOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 10:10" />Taani dosida wode he geellata seerana. Enti oothida daro nagaraa gisho taani enta seeriya wode kawotethati enta bolla dendana. <verse eid="HOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 10:11" />Efreemi kathi yedhanaw dosiya wadhi kessida wofaano mela. Shin taani iya lo77iya morgiyan qambara wothada waaxana. Yihuda asay worxafana; Yayqooba asay shirechana. <verse eid="HOS 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 10:12" />Goday yidi xillotethi hinte bolla bukisana gakanaw iya koyite. Hinte xillotethi zeriyaba gidiko merina siiqo cakana. Hessa gisho, othe biitta worxafite. <verse eid="HOS 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 10:13" />Shin hinte, hinte ogiyaninne hinte daro olanchotan ammanetida gisho, iitatethi zeridi nagaraa cakideta; hinte worduwa ayfiya mideta. <verse eid="HOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 10:14" />Hinte bolla wolqaama oli dendana; beni Kawoy Salmani Beet-Arbela katamaa olidi laallidaysadanne aayetanne nayta dhaysidaysada qassi hinte miixata dhaysana. <verse eid="HOS 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 10:15" />Beetele kataman de7eysato, hinte nagaray daro gidiya gisho hessa melabay hintena gakana. He gallas sa7i wontiya wode Isra7eele kawoy hayqana.<verse eid="HOS 10:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HOS 11" />
  <para style="s1">Goday Isra7eele Dosees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 11:1" />“Isra7eeley na7a de7iya wode iya dosiday tana; ta na7aa Gibxefe xeegas. <verse eid="HOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 11:2" />Taani enta darsada xeegin, enti taape daro haakidi bidosona. Ba7aale eeqatas yarsho yarshidosona; eeqa misiletas ixaane cuyisidosona. <verse eid="HOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 11:3" />Efreema asaa kushiya oykada hemethi tamaarsiday tana, shin enta pathiday tana gideysa erokona. <verse eid="HOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 11:4" />Taani enta qadheninne siiqo wodoron goochas; enta morgefe qambara denthada hokada enta muzas. <verse eid="HOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 11:5" />Enti taako simmonna ixidi Gibxe biitta simmana; Asoore biitta kawoy enta bolla kawotana. <verse eid="HOS 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 11:6" />Enta kataman mashshi dendana; enta katamata pengeta mentherethana; enta zoretay laaletana. <verse eid="HOS 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 11:7" />Ta asay taape haakanaw koyis. Enti Xoossaako waassikoka, I entana bonchenna. <verse eid="HOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 11:8" />Efreemi, taani nena waatada aggo? Isra7eele, taani nena waatada aatha immo? Taani nena waatada Adaama katamaada ootho? Taani nena waatada Xaboyma katamaada ootho? Taani nena daro dosiya gisho ta wozanay hessa ero geenna. <verse eid="HOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 11:9" />Taani hinte giddon de7iya Geeshsha Xoossaafe attishin, ase gidike. Hessa gisho, taani ta suulliya hanquwa hinte bolla ehike; nam7antho Efreema dhaysike; ta hanquwara hinteko yiike. <verse eid="HOS 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 11:10" />Enti Godaa kaallana; ika gaammoda gudana. I gudiya wode iya nayti wuloha baggafe kokorishe yaana. <verse eid="HOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 11:11" />Gibxefe kafoda, Asoorepe holleda paallishe yaana. Taani enta, enta keethan keethan wothana. Taani Goday hessa odas” yaagis.<verse eid="HOS 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Nagara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 11:12" />Efreema asay wordon, Isra7eele asay cimon tana teqidosona. Yihuda asay ammanthiya Geeshsha Xoossaa bolla xaltaamis.<verse eid="HOS 11:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HOS 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 12:1" />Efreema asay wontafe omarsi gakanaw doloha carko oykees woyko yedethees. Enti wordonne geellatethi darsoosona; Asoore biittara caaqidosona; shamaho zayte Gibxe biitta yeddoosona.<verse eid="HOS 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 12:2" />Godaas Yihuda asaara mootoy de7ees; I Yayqooba nayta enta ogiyada seerana; enta oosuwada entaw zaarana. <verse eid="HOS 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 12:3" />Yayqoobi ba aaye ulon de7ishe ba ishaa gindiya oykis. Dicci gakidi Xoossara butetis; <verse eid="HOS 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 12:4" />kiitanchora baaxetidi xoonis. Bana keeha ayfen xeellana mela ba ishaa yeekidi woossis. Yayqoobi Xoossaa Beetelen demmin Xoossay yan iyara haasayis. <verse eid="HOS 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 12:5" />I Godaa, Ubbaafe Wolqaama Xoossaa. Iya eretida sunthay Godaa geetetees. <verse eid="HOS 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 12:6" />Hessa gisho, hinte Xoossaako simmite; siiqonne suure pirdaa minthi oykite; hinte Xoossay oothana gakanaw naagite. <verse eid="HOS 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 12:7" />Zal7anchoy wordo mizaanen zal7ees; I asaa cimmanaw dosees. <verse eid="HOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 12:8" />Efreemi, “Taani daro dure; taani taw aqo demmas. Ta aqo ubban tanan enti bala woyko nagara demmokona. <verse eid="HOS 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 12:9" />Shin taani hintena Gibxe biittafe kessada ehida Godaa, hinte Xoossaa; Shaqara Ba7aale gallas hinte dunkaanen de7idaysada ta hintena zaara dunkaanen wothana. <verse eid="HOS 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 12:10" />Taani nabetas odas; daro qoncethi entaw immas; enta baggara daro leemisota odas” yaagis.<verse eid="HOS 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 12:11" />Galadi iita nagarancho; Galada asati pathonayisata. Enti Galgalan kormata yarshana. Enta yarsho bessay goshshan de7iya keela shuchada laaletana.<verse eid="HOS 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 12:12" />Yayqoobi Soore biitta baqatis; Isra7eeley macho ekanaw une oothis. Koyta immanaw yan dorse heemmis. <verse eid="HOS 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 12:13" />Goday Isra7eele asaa nabeta baggara Gibxe biittafe kessidi he nabeta baggara enta naagis. <verse eid="HOS 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 12:14" />Shin Efreemi Godaa daro hanqethis; I suuthi gussida gisho iya Goday achana; iya cashshaa iyaw zaarana.<verse eid="HOS 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HOS 13" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Hanqoy Isra7eele Bolla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 13:1" />Efreemi odetida wode si7ida ubbay yashshan kokoris; Isra7eele biittan enti bonchetida asi. Shin Ba7aale eeqa goyinnidosona; he nagara gaason hayqidosona. <verse eid="HOS 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 13:2" />Ha77ika nagara bolla nagara oothosona; banta bira sheeshidi bantaw eeqa medhidosona; hiillan oosetida misileta giigisidosona; ubbayka kushe hiillan medhetidosona. Asay entaba odishe, “Yarshiya asay mara eeqa misileta yeerite” yaagosona. <verse eid="HOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 13:3" />Hessa gisho, enti wonta shaara mela woyko wonta xaasa mela woyko carkoy wudummafe denthidi efiya puno mela woyko maskootera keya cuyaa mela gidana.<verse eid="HOS 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 13:4" />Goday “Taani hintena Gibxe biittafe kessada ehida Godaa, hinte Xoossaa. Hinte taape attishin, hara xoossi ereketa; ashshey taape hari baawa. <verse eid="HOS 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 13:5" />Bazzon, mela biittan taani hintena naagas. <verse eid="HOS 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 13:6" />Taani hintena muzin, midi kallidi otortideta; hessafe guye, tana dogideta. <verse eid="HOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 13:7" />Hessa gisho, taani hinte bolla gaammo gidana; maahe mela oge doonan zugana. <verse eid="HOS 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 13:8" />Mari eketida maahe mela taani hintera gahetada ta hintena puuzana. Taani hintena gaammoda mentherethana; bazzo do7ada hintena pooshshana.<verse eid="HOS 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 13:9" />“Isra7eele asato, hinte ta bolla, hintena maaddeysa bolla dendida gisho ta hintena dhaysana. <verse eid="HOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HOS 13:10" />Hinte tana, ‘Nuus kawonne halaqa imma’ yaagidi oychideta. Hintena ashshiya hinte kawoy anee? Katamatan de7iya hinte halaqati awun de7oona? <verse eid="HOS 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HOS 13:11" />Taani ta hanquwan hintew kawo immas; ta yiluwan iya denthas. <verse eid="HOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HOS 13:12" />Efreema balaynne nagaray xaafetidi uttis. <verse eid="HOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HOS 13:13" />Iqethi oykida maccasi un7eteysa mela un7i iya bolla yaana. Shin I eri bayna na7a; yeletiya wodey gakin, ba aaye ulope wodhonna ixiya na7a mela. <verse eid="HOS 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HOS 13:14" />Taani enta duufope ashshana; hayqo wolqaafe wozana. Hayqo, ne gadoy awunee? Si7oole, ne dhaysoy awunee? Taani ta asaas qadhetike. <verse eid="HOS 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HOS 13:15" />Efreemi ba ishata giddon minnikoka, Goday yeddida doloha bagga carkoy bazzofe carkishe yaana; iya pultoy eqana; iya haathay melana. I minjida al7o miishe ubbay bonqetana. <verse eid="HOS 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HOS 13:16" />Samaare asay banta Xoossaa bolla geellatida gisho, seera ekanaw bessees. Enti mashshan busetana; enta nayti tinchetana; enta qanthatida maccasata uloy daaketana” yaagees.<verse eid="HOS 13:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="HOS 14" />
  <para style="s1">Godaako Simoy Ehiya Anjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HOS 14:1" />Isra7eele asaw, hinte nagaraa gaason dhubetidi kundida gisho ha77i Godaa, hinte Xoossaako simmite. <verse eid="HOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HOS 14:2" />Godaako simmidi, haysada yaagidi woossite; “Nu nagara ubbaafe nuna maara; nuuni nu mettersha ayfe gidida galataa new shiishana mela ne nuna ne keehatethan shiisha eka. <verse eid="HOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HOS 14:3" />Asoorey nuna ashshena; nu ola paratanka ammanetoko. Nuuni nu kushen medhida eeqa misileta ubbaa, ‘Nu xoossata’ gooko. Aaway baynaysatas qadhetey nena” yaagite.<verse eid="HOS 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HOS 14:4" />Goday, “Ta hanqoy entafe simmida gisho, taani enta makalla hanuwape enta pathada, enta wozanape siiqana. <verse eid="HOS 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HOS 14:5" />Taani Isra7eele asaas aka gidana; enti ciishshada ciyidi, Libaanose zigaa mela xapho yeddana. <verse eid="HOS 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HOS 14:6" />Enta dolay cil7ana; enti shamahoda lo77ana. Enta sawoy Libaanose zigada tonku gaana. <verse eid="HOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HOS 14:7" />Asay simmidi ta kuya garsan shempana; enti dolada cil7ana; enti woyneda ciiyana; Libaanose woyne ushshada eretiyaba gidana. <verse eid="HOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HOS 14:8" />Efreema asaw, hizape guye eeqa misilera taw ay gahetethi de7ii? Hinte woosa si7eynne hintena naagey tana. Taani cil7o zigaa mela; hinte ayfe ayfana mela oothey tana” yaagees.<verse eid="HOS 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HOS 14:9" />Cincatethi de7iya oonika haysa akeeko; wozani de7iya oonika hessa ero. Godaa ogey suure; xilloti he ogiyara hemetoosona; shin nagaranchoti iyan dhubetoosona.<verse eid="HOS 14:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HOS 14" />
</usx>